om/users/tebriel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tebriel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tebriel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tebriel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tebriel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tebriel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tebriel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tebriel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"labels":[{"id":2941098091,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTQxMDk4MDkx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OptimalBits/bull/labels/released","name":"released","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2020-05-05T19:34:45Z","updated_at":"2021-07-19T14:05:55Z","closed_at":"2021-07-15T13:02:17Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OptimalBits/bull/pulls/1720","html_url":"https://github.com/OptimalBits/bull/pull/1720","diff_url":"https://github.com/OptimalBits/bull/pull/1720.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/OptimalBits/bull/pull/1720.patch","merged_at":"2021-07-15T13:02:17Z"},"body":"Overrides the options.redis settings for clientName for creating a new\r\nclient\r\n\r\nWhen specifying `createClient` as part of the `Bull.QueueOptions` there is no way to know the `Queue`'s name (from `queue.clientName`).\r\n\r\nWhen calling `queue.process`, [`this.setHandler`](https://github.com/OptimalBits/bull/blob/develop/lib/queue.js#L621) is invoked which calls [`setWorkerName`](https://github.com/OptimalBits/bull/blob/develop/lib/worker.js#L12-L21) however this only does so on the `client`, and not on the `eclient` (`subscriber`) nor on the `bclient`.\r\n\r\nI opted to hand the `clientName` via `connectionName` in the redis options (overriding the defaults passed in to the `QueueOptions` to allow the `createClient` function to determine what to do with these options.\r\n\r\nAdditionally I slightly tweaked the example to note that this value is present and to better showcase how to use the `createClient` function.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OptimalBits/bull/issues/1720/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OptimalBits/bull/issues/1720/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OptimalBits/bull/issues/1780","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OptimalBits/bull","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OptimalBits/bull/issues/1780/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OptimalBits/bull/issues/1780/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OptimalBits/bull/issues/1780/events","html_url":"https://github.com/OptimalBits/bull/pull/1780","id":647316376,"node_id":"MDExOlB1bGxSZXF1ZXN0NDQxMzY0MTkw","number":1780,"title":"fix: error when .lua scripts missing in builded bundle","user":{"login":"zhelnov","id":13071129,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDcxMTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13071129?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhelnov","html_url":"https://github.com/zhelnov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhelnov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhelnov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhelnov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhelnov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhelnov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhelnov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhelnov/repos","events_url"